<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-TOWNSEND DOUBTFUL FOR WELSH TEST.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-TOWNSEND DOUBTFUL FOR WELSH TEST.</headline>
<dateline>EDINBURGH 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotland's Gregor Townsend may be forced to withdraw from Saturday's opening Five Nations encounter with Wales at Murrayfield after injuring a shoulder in training on Wednesday.</p>
<p>If the talented 24-year-old centre fails to recover in time, Ron Eriksson of London Scottish will replace him.</p>
